# Build artefacts from install.sh / build-zip.sh.
# out/ is several GB: boot images are 128 MB each and the recovery zips are
# around 290 MB. GitHub rejects anything over 100 MB, so a `git add .` here
# fails outright. They are reproducible with ./install.sh.
out/

# Staging directories used by the pmOS tools.
*.zip
*.img
